ind":"update","title":"SPACE WALK Demo - Update Roundup","summary":"The SPACE WALK Demo has now been live for almost two weeks, and since launch I’ve been working through player feedback, bug reports, performance issues, and general improvements.A lot has changed already, so I wanted to put everything together in one place for those who may not be following the individual patch notes on Discord.ADDEDNew Bunny Hop traversal for more immersive movement on the Moon.Backpack attachment system, allowing up to three tools to be carried externally.Player naming during ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:26:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3310910-1846651706674435","game_id":"steam-3310910","kind":"announcement","title":"SPACE WALK is part of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"I’m proud to announce that SPACE WALK is taking part in Steam Next Fest.The free demo is already available, letting you step into the ASTRA Pioneer Program, live aboard your own orbital station, prepare for EVA operations, and explore the lunar surface.Since the demo launched, I’ve already received a lot of useful feedback, bug reports, and observations from players, and that feedback is helping shape the game as development continues toward Early Access.If you haven’t tried SPACE WALK yet, Stea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T14:21:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674435","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3310910-1845383656385322","game_id":"steam-3310910","kind":"announcement","title":"SPACE WALK Demo is Live Now!","summary":"The SPACE WALK demo is now available to play on Steam. After 2 years building, testing, changing and refining the game, it feels great to finally let people experience it for themselves. In the demo, you join the Pioneer Program, live aboard your own orbital station, prepare for EVA and head down to the lunar surface to explore, collect resources and uncover what’s out there. If you play the demo, I’d love to hear what you think. ------------------------------------------------------------------","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T07:54:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385322","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3310910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3310910":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3310910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z"},"5251920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:22Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3310910","app_id":3310910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8b4d74ee1a1c2b16632560793ae4d87ca02f79a10b0895b0dc2d3977710ce1be","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"SPACE WALK is a hands-on first-person astronaut simulation where you operate an orbital station and